Numbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"118821","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"398193","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"54880","synopsis":"Lugh heads to the neighboring kingdom of Swoigel. Once a month, he travels to the Viekone region in order to visit Dia. During his visit, together Lugh and Dia develop new spells. Meanwhile, left back home by themselves, Tarte and Maha hold a tea party together. While Lugh is gone, they have a fun time preparing a special meal together, but--","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qVjvCUqUeMposfbrlLmpdnZi5cZ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Lugh heads to the neighboring kingdom of Swoigel. Once a month, he travels to the Viekone region in order to visit Dia. During his visit, together Lugh and Dia develop new spells. Meanwhile, left back home by themselves, Tarte and Maha hold a tea party together. While Lugh is gone, they have a fun time preparing a special meal together, but--","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qVjvCUqUeMposfbrlLmpdnZi5cZ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"129898","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"47790","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"118821","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"398193","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"55125","synopsis":"With the success of his cosmetics brand Orna, by acquiring financial power and the Balor Trading Company's information network, Lugh has gained even greater strength as an assassin. However, since being reincarnated in this world, Lugh still has not completed a proper assassination. Then, Lugh's father Cian tells him that he doesn't have to become an assassin--","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zLJk3klQFrryg1pNOeZ7GlpLs6Q.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"With the success of his cosmetics brand Orna, by acquiring financial power and the Balor Trading Company's information network, Lugh has gained even greater strength as an assassin. However, since being reincarnated in this world, Lugh still has not completed a proper assassination. Then, Lugh's father Cian tells him that he doesn't have to become an assassin--","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zLJk3klQFrryg1pNOeZ7GlpLs6Q.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"129898","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"47790","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"118821","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"398193","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"55356","synopsis":"Lugh receives a request for assassination. He takes Talt with him and goes to a commercial city, Pisaal. He decides to gather information beforehand to justify whether the target needs to be assassinated. Once there, Lugh saw the suffering of the people that was caused by his target. It's a tragic sight as a young child is forced to sell drugs while her mother was emaciated and was also addicted to it. Thus, Lugh formulates an assassination plan based on the information that Maha had collected. He was successful in killing for the first time in this life, though he soon felt the weight of his action and became emotional after witnessing the wife of the target grieving.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6rCvsmBa2bHhvBcTVbrN6BWc2qv.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Lugh receives a request for assassination. He takes Talt with him and goes to a commercial city, Pisaal. He decides to gather information beforehand to justify whether the target needs to be assassinated. Once there, Lugh saw the suffering of the people that was caused by his target. It's a tragic sight as a young child is forced to sell drugs while her mother was emaciated and was also addicted to it. Thus, Lugh formulates an assassination plan based on the information that Maha had collected. He was successful in killing for the first time in this life, though he soon felt the weight of his action and became emotional after witnessing the wife of the target grieving.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6rCvsmBa2bHhvBcTVbrN6BWc2qv.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"129898","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"47790","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"118821","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"398193","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"55537","synopsis":"In front of Lugh and Talt who've just finished a magical training camp in a deserted island, Maha appeared with information. It's about Swoigel kingdom being engulfed in a civil war. Lugh heads toward Dia, but Viecone territory seemed peaceful as always. Lugh was still worried, but Dia ignored him and suggested to go on a date instead.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/23CPdyT04wT0pkSsc8cMUNb9BZ7.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"In front of Lugh and Talt who've just finished a magical training camp in a deserted island, Maha appeared with information. It's about Swoigel kingdom being engulfed in a civil war. Lugh heads toward Dia, but Viecone territory seemed peaceful as always. Lugh was still worried, but Dia ignored him and suggested to go on a date instead.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/23CPdyT04wT0pkSsc8cMUNb9BZ7.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"129898","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"47790","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"118821","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"398193","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"55653","synopsis":"Lugh got a assasination request for Dia. And the principal is Count Viecone, who is Dia's father and Cian's old friend. Cian expects Lugh can finish the assasination. But if he refuses it, Cian will do it with his own hands.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rgATxJa78wYVi4ssi8blU0YFMmn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Lugh got a assasination request for Dia. And the principal is Count Viecone, who is Dia's father and Cian's old friend. Cian expects Lugh can finish the assasination. But if he refuses it, Cian will do it with his own hands.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rgATxJa78wYVi4ssi8blU0YFMmn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"129898","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"47790","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"118821","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"398193","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"55758","synopsis":"Lugh and Dia's father come up with a plan to fake Dia's death and safely sneak her into to the Tuatha Dé region. Unfortunately, the arrival of Setanta MacNess thwarts the plan before they can enact it. As Setanta is the wielder of Gae Bolg, Lugh knows that he will not survive a direct confrontation with him, so he fires a magnetically propelled tungsten projectile into the atmosphere and stalls Setanta long enough for it to obliterate him. Afterwards, the Tuatha Dé family adopts Dia under the guise of being Lugh's younger sister, completing the mission. Sometime later, Lugh receives word that the Hero, Lord Epona Rhiannon, has arrived in the Alvan Kingdom.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qJGOah7NjTSv7JNWhAYkgqVIwwm.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"Lugh and Dia's father come up with a plan to fake Dia's death and safely sneak her into to the Tuatha Dé region. Unfortunately, the arrival of Setanta MacNess thwarts the plan before they can enact it. As Setanta is the wielder of Gae Bolg, Lugh knows that he will not survive a direct confrontation with him, so he fires a magnetically propelled tungsten projectile into the atmosphere and stalls Setanta long enough for it to obliterate him. Afterwards, the Tuatha Dé family adopts Dia under the guise of being Lugh's younger sister, completing the mission. Sometime later, Lugh receives word that the Hero, Lord Epona Rhiannon, has arrived in the Alvan Kingdom.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qJGOah7NjTSv7JNWhAYkgqVIwwm.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:129898","mal:47790"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16055","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"129898","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"47790","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"118821","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id